{
  "dom_id": "step-e22714",
  "name": "Example: Solving Problems Involving Multiplying Negative Fractions",
  "problem": "The temperature of a liquid decreases by $\\dfrac{4}{5}\\,^\\circ\\text{C}$ each minute for $\\dfrac{3}{2}$ minutes. What is the total change in temperature?",
  "worked_solution": "The temperature decreases by $\\dfrac{4}{5}\\,^\\circ\\text{C}$ each minute.\n\nSince the temperature decreases, the change each minute is $-\\dfrac{4}{5}.$\n\nThe change occurs for $\\dfrac{3}{2}$ minutes, so the total change is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{3}{2} \\times \\left(-\\dfrac{4}{5}\\right).\n$$\n\nEvaluating the product, we get\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{3}{2} \\times \\left(-\\dfrac{4}{5}\\right)\n= -\\dfrac{3 \\times 4}{2 \\times 5}\n= -\\dfrac{12}{10}\n= -\\dfrac{6}{5}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the total change in temperature is $-\\dfrac{6}{5}\\,^\\circ\\text{C}.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e22714\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Solving Problems Involving Multiplying Negative Fractions</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e22714\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>The temperature of a liquid decreases by <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"5.118ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 2203.6 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\dfrac{4}{5}\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-34\" d=\"M462 0Q444 3 333 3Q217 3 199 0H190V46H221Q241 46 248 46T265 48T279 53T286 61Q287 63 287 115V165H28V211L179 442Q332 674 334 675Q336 677 355 677H373L379 671V211H471V165H379V114Q379 73 379 66T385 54Q393 47 442 46H471V0H462ZM293 211V545L74 212L183 211H293Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2218\" d=\"M55 251Q55 328 112 386T249 444T386 388T444 249Q444 171 388 113T250 55Q170 55 113 112T55 251ZM245 403Q188 403 142 361T96 250Q96 183 141 140T250 96Q284 96 313 109T354 135T375 160Q403 197 403 250Q403 313 360 358T245 403Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-43\" d=\"M56 342Q56 428 89 500T174 615T283 681T391 705Q394 705 400 705T408 704Q499 704 569 636L582 624L612 663Q639 700 643 704Q644 704 647 704T653 705H657Q660 705 666 699V419L660 413H626Q620 419 619 430Q610 512 571 572T476 651Q457 658 426 658Q322 658 252 588Q173 509 173 342Q173 221 211 151Q232 111 263 84T328 45T384 29T428 24Q517 24 571 93T626 244Q626 251 632 257H660L666 251V236Q661 133 590 56T403 -21Q262 -21 159 83T56 342Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"620\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-34\" x=\"60\" y=\"676\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"60\" y=\"-687\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(860,0)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2218\" x=\"235\" y=\"513\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-43\" x=\"1481\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> each minute for <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.999ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 860.5 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\dfrac{3}{2}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-33\" d=\"M127 463Q100 463 85 480T69 524Q69 579 117 622T233 665Q268 665 277 664Q351 652 390 611T430 522Q430 470 396 421T302 350L299 348Q299 347 308 345T337 336T375 315Q457 262 457 175Q457 96 395 37T238 -22Q158 -22 100 21T42 130Q42 158 60 175T105 193Q133 193 151 175T169 130Q169 119 166 110T159 94T148 82T136 74T126 70T118 67L114 66Q165 21 238 21Q2